[thin] Functional axial bearing at the measured water-regulator body-to-neck shoulder. The short native neck between the housing shoulder and outlet collar bounds this approximately 2 mm axial web. Its surfaces follow the actual installed radial profile with 0.25 mm radial and axial cap air; this is the shoulder that constrains axial movement.
alternatives: Increasing the axial web to 3 mm intersects the adjacent housing or outlet collar unless their fitted cavity is enlarged. Enlarging that cavity removes the measured axial capture. Additional radial stock does not widen the available axial neck.
